    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37281" root="كند" body-key="k">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَنَدَ</span></b> , (S, &amp;c.), aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَنُدَ</span></b> , (A, MS,) or 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَنِدَ</span></b> , (ElBasáïr,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَنَدَ نِعْمَةً</span>, (TA,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُنُودٌ</span>, (S.
K, &amp;c.) <i>He was ungrateful; he disacknowledged
a benefit.</i> (S, A, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنْ سَأَلْتَهُ نَكَدَ وَإِنْ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعْطَيْتَهُ كَنَدَ</span> <i>If thou ask of him, he refuseth; and
if thou give him. he is ungrateful.</i> (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَنَدَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبَاهُ النِّعْمَة</span> (K) <i>He disacknowleged his father's
beneficence.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَنَذُهُ</span>, (S, L,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَنْدٌ</span>,
(K,) <i>He cut,</i> or <i>severed, it.</i> (S, L, K.)

